# Bottlewise data-adapter env. Copy to `.env` and fill in. NEVER commit `.env`.
# See docs/CREDENTIALS_SETUP.md for the full signup runbook.

# ── Amazon Product Advertising API 5.0 ────────────────────────────────
# https://webservices.amazon.com/paapi5/documentation/register-for-pa-api.html
# Required: AMAZON_PA_ACCESS_KEY, AMAZON_PA_SECRET_KEY, AMAZON_PA_ASSOCIATE_TAG.
# Optional: AMAZON_PA_MARKETPLACE (default www.amazon.com).
AMAZON_PA_ACCESS_KEY=
AMAZON_PA_SECRET_KEY=
AMAZON_PA_ASSOCIATE_TAG=
AMAZON_PA_MARKETPLACE=www.amazon.com

# ── Walmart Affiliate API ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# https://developer.walmart.com/api/us/affiliate/search
# Generate the keypair locally with `scripts/gen-walmart-key.sh`, then
# paste the PRIVATE key here (newlines as literal \n) and upload the
# PUBLIC key to Walmart's developer portal.
WALMART_CONSUMER_ID=
WALMART_PRIVATE_KEY=
WALMART_PRIVATE_KEY_VERSION=1

# ── Target RedSky ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Target rotates a public visitor key. Default in code is the one
# observed at the time the adapter was written; override here if it
# starts returning 401/403.
# TARGET_REDSKY_VISITOR_KEY=

# ── Supabase (server-only writes from the adapter pipeline) ───────────
# Required when running `pnpm seed --db` or `pnpm merge`.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# ── Future: Anthropic narrator endpoint ───────────────────────────────
# The mobile app reads this from EXPO_PUBLIC_NARRATOR_URL — it points at
# YOUR own Cloudflare Worker / Vercel Edge / Supabase Edge function that
# holds the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY server-side. The key NEVER lives in the
# client bundle.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_NARRATOR_URL=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=    # only on the server that calls Claude
